  "question": "Suppose that $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are two distinct numbers in the interval $(0,\\pi)$. If $\\sin\\alpha+\\sin\\beta=\\sqrt3(\\cos\\alpha-\\cos\\beta)$, then the value of $\\sin3\\alpha+\\sin3\\beta$ is",
